### Full Demo Recording
![VFX Preview Tool Demo](C:\Users\dangt\.gemini\antigravity\brain\f6662d39-ec39-41af-83b2-20439d6b2519\vfx_preview_test_1774073962773.webp)

### Controls
- **Search** — real-time text filter by name/path
- **Type filter** — Tất cả / Spine / Sprite buttons
- **Animation** — ▶ Play/Pause, ⏮⏭ Step, slider scrub, FPS selector (8-30)
- **Phase tabs** — switch between cast1/cast2/hit sub-animations
- **Keyboard** — Space=play, ←→=step, Esc=close
